      "message": "It is indeed confusing, but I did intend to use the while loop for both NB and WB case. It happens to NB when the buffer is partially full or when we wrote more than BTM_SCO_DATA_SIZE_MAX. Abstract this change to https://android-review.googlesource.com/c/platform/packages/modules/Bluetooth/+/2184725 PTAL.",
