      "message": "It shouldn\u0027t. For the code logic, it only happens when we somehow couldn\u0027t consume the data in the btm_pcm_buf by encoding it into the buffer in msbc_info. In that case, we\u0027d like to try to call the encode and make some space in the msbc_info buffer that we can use to consume the pcm data in the btm_pcm_buf. However, it is an abnormal condition if happens. Added a warning log for it just in case.",
