      "writtenOn": "2022-08-13T09:46:41Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I move the MSBC_CODE_SIZE into ::wbs and also put the check in the sco::wbs::encode(). It is not necessary for the caller to check that in advance. The logic behind this is similar to an IO read/write that the caller only need to know how much of the data is digested.",
      "parentUuid": "c668b5bf_11e2d484",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 250,
        "startChar": 30,
